## test5.malang - Comments

start

## This is a standard single-line comment. It should be ignored.

#* This is a multi-line comment.
   It spans across several lines.
   The scanner should skip all of this text,
   but the line counter should keep ticking up!
*#

declare X = 10 ; ## Inline comment after some code

#* A single-line multi-line comment *#

finish